@startuml KTOB_06_packages
title KTOB - Logical Module Dependency Rules
package "api" as Api
package "security" as Security
package "reader/privacy" as Reader
package "export" as Export
package "library/journal/collections" as Library
package "catalog" as Catalog
package "advisor" as Advisor
package "acquisition" as Acquisition
package "provider adapters" as Integration
package "shared contracts" as Shared
Api ..> Security
Api ..> Reader
Api ..> Library
Api ..> Catalog
Api ..> Advisor
Api ..> Acquisition
Reader ..> Shared
Export ..> Reader : owner identity
Export ..> Library : export reading records
Export ..> Advisor : export preferences
Library ..> Catalog : work contract
Advisor ..> Reader : consent / boundaries
Advisor ..> Library : permitted history
Advisor ..> Catalog : works
Acquisition ..> Catalog : work / edition
Catalog ..> Integration : metadata
Advisor ..> Integration : AI
Acquisition ..> Integration : sellers [BLOCKED]
Integration ..> Shared
note bottom
Dependency arrows indicate required interfaces.
No circular module dependencies, direct cross-module
persistence access or separate runtime instances.
end note
@enduml
